{"name":"Spring Garden","hex":"#558961","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Spring Garden","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A number of places, including:\nA census-designated place in Plumas County, California, United States.\nA township in York County, Pennsylvania, United States.","A census-designated place in Plumas County, California, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Spring_Garden"}],"entries":[{"title":"Spring Garden Road, Halifax","blocks":[{"text":"The Spring Garden Road area, along with Barrington Street is a major commercial and cultural district in Halifax, Nova Scotia, Canada. It acquired its name from the fresh water spring that flows directly beneath it. It comprises Spring Garden Road, South Park Street, and a number of smaller side streets. The area is considered to be one of the trendiest areas in Halifax and is the busiest shopping district east of Quebec."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Spring_Garden_Road_at_Queen_Street.JPG/330px-Spring_Garden_Road_at_Queen_Street.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spring_Garden_Road%2C_Halifax","wikidata":"Q7580500"},{"title":"Spring Garden, Guyana","blocks":[{"text":"Spring Garden is a village in the Pomeroon-Supenaam region of Guyana."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spring_Garden%2C_Guyana","wikidata":"Q38251163"},{"title":"Garden","blocks":[{"text":"A garden is a planned space, usually outdoors, set aside for the cultivation, display, and enjoyment of plants and other forms of nature. The single feature identifying even the wildest wild garden is control. The garden can incorporate both natural and artificial materials."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Brooklyn_Botanic_Garden_New_York_May_2015_010.jpg/330px-Brooklyn_Botanic_Garden_New_York_May_2015_010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org